    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rgjt](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rgjt) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 76.024 depth occurred on Oct 11 2025 56 km SE of Severo-Kuril’sk, Russia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 50.3263 longitude 156.6974. It impacted 3 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
